title: "MicroRTS Deep-RL Agent"
abstract: >-
  A competitive real-time-strategy agent for MicroRTS, trained with PPO over a
  hand-written Java<->Python bridge, opponent curricula and self-play, targeting
  the IEEE-CoG MicroRTS competition winner RAISocketAI. Master's thesis, UCLouvain.
